From 7fa1b28ad6e13406f5fd58a8c2a2976b516261e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Atlas <atlas@local>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 10:32:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] perf: fail-fast timeouts, fast-path tuning, config-aware
 caching

- Default provider timeout 120s -> 30s (agent + all 5 adapters)
- Fix failover matching: 'timed out' errors now trigger immediate failover
- Retries 4 -> 2 per provider
- Fast-path thresholds 35 -> 60 tokens, data 256 -> 512 chars
- Semantic/payload caches keyed on agent provider/model config version
- Add bypassCache param to force fresh runs
